  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Water Security, Resilience and Innovation in Eastern Africa through Science, Capacity Development and Integrated Water Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme aims to strengthen water security and climate resilience in Eastern Africa by enhancing hydrological monitoring systems, advancing groundwater and water resource assessments, and reinforcing technical and institutional capacity in water management. This will be carried out through targeted technical missions, installation of monitoring equipment, stakeholder consultations on transboundary aquifers, and specialised capacity-building initiatives. The programme will promote science-based approaches to sustainable water resources management.</narrative>
  </description>
